        {
            "id": "https://woodworkbober.com/more-info-coming-soon/",
            "url": "https://woodworkbober.com/more-info-coming-soon/",
            "title": "Solid olive wood coffee table with live edge.",
            "summary": "Vision: The idea of ​​bringing a piece of nature into our homes is fascinating and relaxing. I believe that this contact with less processed materials in our homes creates a link between the world of cement and plastic we live in and the nature that&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<h3>                                                           </h3>\n<h3><figure class=\"post__image post__image--left\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"file:///C:/Users/Coco.Bober/Documents/Publii/sites/woodworkbober/input/media/posts/1/DSC03160Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3465\" height=\"2624\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" srcset=\"file:///C:/Users/Coco.Bober/Documents/Publii/sites/woodworkbober/input/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03160Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-xs.jpg 640w ,file:///C:/Users/Coco.Bober/Documents/Publii/sites/woodworkbober/input/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03160Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-sm.jpg 768w ,file:///C:/Users/Coco.Bober/Documents/Publii/sites/woodworkbober/input/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03160Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-md.jpg 1024w ,file:///C:/Users/Coco.Bober/Documents/Publii/sites/woodworkbober/input/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03160Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-lg.jpg 1366w ,file:///C:/Users/Coco.Bober/Documents/Publii/sites/woodworkbober/input/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03160Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-xl.jpg 1600w ,file:///C:/Users/Coco.Bober/Documents/Publii/sites/woodworkbober/input/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03160Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-2xl.jpg 1920w\"></figure></h3>\n<h3>Vision:</h3>\n<p>The idea of ​​bringing a piece of nature into our homes is fascinating and relaxing. I believe that this contact with less processed materials in our homes creates a link between the world of cement and plastic we live in and the nature that is our root on this planet. While the functionality of a table is important, leaving small indentations that recall the irregularity of nature is a subtle balance in the construction and design of our tables.</p>\n<h3>Materials:</h3>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\" data-is-empty=\"false\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/2/gallery/DSC03181Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026.jpg\" data-size=\"3936x2624\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/2/gallery/DSC03181Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"480\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>Kiln-dried olive wood table with small decorations and epoxy resin inlays.</p>\n<p>Ideal for indoor use, designed for apartments, with ample storage space underneath. Minimalist and sturdy metal base.</p>\n<p>Mainly handcrafted using traditional tools.</p>\n<p>The quality of the materials used is paramount to us, so we select premium woods and use high-quality finishing products. In this case, we rely on Rubiomonocoat's certification as an environmentally friendly and safe product, as well as the adhesive used in some sections.</p>\n<h3>Dimensions</h3>\n<p>Size: 78 cm long x 43 cm wide x 46 cm high</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"file:///C:/Users/Coco.Bober/Documents/Publii/sites/woodworkbober/input/media/posts/1/DSC03175Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3725\" height=\"2518\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" srcset=\"file:///C:/Users/Coco.Bober/Documents/Publii/sites/woodworkbober/input/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03175Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-xs.jpg 640w ,file:///C:/Users/Coco.Bober/Documents/Publii/sites/woodworkbober/input/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03175Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-sm.jpg 768w ,file:///C:/Users/Coco.Bober/Documents/Publii/sites/woodworkbober/input/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03175Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-md.jpg 1024w ,file:///C:/Users/Coco.Bober/Documents/Publii/sites/woodworkbober/input/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03175Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-lg.jpg 1366w ,file:///C:/Users/Coco.Bober/Documents/Publii/sites/woodworkbober/input/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03175Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-xl.jpg 1600w ,file:///C:/Users/Coco.Bober/Documents/Publii/sites/woodworkbober/input/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03175Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-2xl.jpg 1920w\"></figure>",
            "author": {
                "name": "Francisco Bober"
            },
            "tags": [
                   "English",
                   "Coffee table"
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-10-08T19:54:04+02:00",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-15T17:34:29+02:00"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://woodworkbober.com/solid-olive-wood-coffee-table-lived-edge/",
            "url": "https://woodworkbober.com/solid-olive-wood-coffee-table-lived-edge/",
            "title": "Mesa de centro de madera maciza de olivo con borde natural.",
            "summary": "La idea de traer un pedazo de naturaleza al hogar es fascinante y relajante. Creo que este contacto con materiales menos procesados ​​en nuestros hogares crea un vínculo entre el mundo del cemento y el plástico en el que vivimos y la naturaleza que es&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p> </p>\n<h3><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Visión</span></span>:<figure class=\"post__image post__image--left\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/DSC03160Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3465\" height=\"2624\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" srcset=\"https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03160Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-xs.jpg 640w ,https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03160Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-sm.jpg 768w ,https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03160Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-md.jpg 1024w ,https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03160Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-lg.jpg 1366w ,https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03160Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-xl.jpg 1600w ,https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03160Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-2xl.jpg 1920w\"></figure></h3>\n<p><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">La idea de traer un pedazo de naturaleza al hogar es fascinante y relajante.</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Creo que este contacto con materiales menos procesados ​​en nuestros hogares crea un vínculo entre el mundo del cemento y el plástico en el que vivimos y la naturaleza que es nuestra raíz en este planeta.</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Si bien la funcionalidad de una mesa es importante, dejar pequeñas hendiduras que recuerdan la irregularidad de la naturaleza es un sutil equilibrio en la construcción y el diseño de nuestras mesas.</span></span></p>\n<h3>Materiales:</h3>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\" data-is-empty=\"false\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/gallery/DSC03181Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026.jpg\" data-size=\"3936x2624\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/gallery/DSC03181Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"480\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Mesa de madera de olivo secada al horno, con pequeñas decoraciones e incrustaciones de resina epoxi.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Ideal para interiores, diseñada para apartamentos, con amplio espacio de almacenamiento debajo.</span></span><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\"> Base metálica minimalista y robusta.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Fabricada mayoritariamente a mano con herramientas tradicionales.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">La calidad de los materiales utilizados es fundamental para nosotros, por lo que seleccionamos maderas de primera calidad y utilizamos productos de acabado de alta calidad.</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">En este caso, confiamos en la certificación de Rubiomonocoat como un producto ecológico y seguro para las personas, así como en el adhesivo utilizado en algunas secciones.</span></span></p>\n<h3>Dimensiones</h3>\n<p>Tamaño: 78 cm de largo x 43 cm de ancho x 46 cm de alto</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/DSC03175Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3725\" height=\"2518\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" srcset=\"https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03175Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-xs.jpg 640w ,https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03175Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-sm.jpg 768w ,https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03175Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-md.jpg 1024w ,https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03175Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-lg.jpg 1366w ,https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03175Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-xl.jpg 1600w ,https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/responsive/DSC03175Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026-2xl.jpg 1920w\"></figure>",
            "image": "https://woodworkbober.com/media/posts/1/DSC03182Table-Olive-and-epoxy-2026.jpg",
